{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute pixel heroes that live on your desktop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idlewood Outpost is an idle desktop pet game where a band of pixel RPG heroes guard your taskbar, collect loot, and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.poster.avif?t=1761907314\" width=720 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.webm?t=1761907314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.mp4?t=1761907314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Idle by Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the game run while you work, study, or doomscroll. Your heroes will patrol, battle, and level up all on their own \u2014 no punishment, no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it as a tiny fantasy outpost existing quietly in the corner of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.poster.avif?t=1761907314\" width=720 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.webm?t=1761907314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.mp4?t=1761907314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optional Depth, Cozy Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you do feel like checking in, there\u2019s loot to hoover up, artifacts to find, new heroes and mounts to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no penalties or stress \u2014 just the occasional dopamine rush when you find a rare artifact or level up a hero!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Growing World In Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an evolving game. Planned updates include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 More unique heroes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 More mounts, artifacts &amp; monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Personal housing you can decorate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/96b734404675b02c3f9073e23768d8a2.poster.avif?t=1761907314\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/96b734404675b02c3f9073e23768d8a2.webm?t=1761907314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897350?t=1761907314","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897350?t=1761907314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/80bc6b59b497dccd5642a11f5c9d86ac25cd6b2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761907314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/80bc6b59b497dccd5642a11f5c9d86ac25cd6b2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761907314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3914120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute pixel heroes that live on your desktop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idlewood Outpost is an idle desktop pet game where a band of pixel RPG heroes guard your taskbar, collect loot, and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.poster.avif?t=1761907314\" width=720 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.webm?t=1761907314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.mp4?t=1761907314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Idle by Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the game run while you work, study, or doomscroll. Your heroes will patrol, battle, and level up all on their own \u2014 no punishment, no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it as a tiny fantasy outpost existing quietly in the corner of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.poster.avif?t=1761907314\" width=720 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.webm?t=1761907314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.mp4?t=1761907314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optional Depth, Cozy Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you do feel like checking in, there\u2019s loot to hoover up, artifacts to find, new heroes and mounts to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no penalties or stress \u2014 just the occasional dopamine rush when you find a rare artifact or level up a hero!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Growing World In Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an evolving game. Planned updates include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 More unique heroes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 More mounts, artifacts &amp; monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Personal housing you can decorate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/96b734404675b02c3f9073e23768d8a2.poster.avif?t=1761907314\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/96b734404675b02c3f9073e23768d8a2.webm?t=1761907314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Tidepool Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/c81804547eaf40460eabcc8b19d6bd91392f7826/header.jpg?t=1761907314","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> App